      "reason": "source_audit: [{\"quote\": \"拿起玻璃咖啡壶朝该杯完成一次倾倒动作\", \"reason\": \"E1 with relation right_of is ungrounded; the source clause specifies picking up the pot and orienting it toward the cup for pouring, not placing it right_of the cup\"}, {\"quote\": \"完成一次倾倒动作，回正并放回原位\", \"reason\": \"E3 restore_required already includes upright return and release to origin, so the separate E1 placing the pot on the heating base is a redundant added act; moreover '放回原位' (return to original position) is not grounded to the heating base as the reference\"}]",
